      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions\n- **Sub-workflow trigger:** Acceptance criteria require **Execute Workflow Trigger** (not a webhook), matching the workflow step list.\n- **Minimal AI graph:** **AI Agent** + **OpenAI Chat Model** only (no tools/memory). Input: `userMessageText`; output: `aiResponseText` plus passthrough `chatId` when present.\n- **No downstream workflow:** Does not call **Chatbot - Send Answer to User** in this file.",
